.TH AVR\-AUTH\-LOGIN 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-auth-login \- Authenticate via browser and store credentials.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr auth login
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Authenticate via browser and store credentials.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-provider\fR \fICHOICE\fR
OAuth provider to use for CLI login. (choices: google, github; default: github)
.TP
\fB\-\-email\fR \fITEXT\fR
Work email. Routes through your company's SSO if its domain requires it, ignoring --provider.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-auth (1),
.BR avr-auth-logout (1),
.BR avr-auth-status (1),
.BR avr-auth-switch (1)
